WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:01.901
-Nikolaj, it is great
to see you again.

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.703
-Great to see you.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.737
-I was going to ask you this

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:06.973
