talking backstage.

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:09.842
You've been around the world
in like the last couple weeks.

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:11.811
Do you have any idea
where you are right now?

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:12.945
[ Laughter ]

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:14.380
-I'm in sunny New York.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.049
-Yeah, sunny -- [ Laughs ]
-What a beautiful day.

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:17.483
-Sunny New York, yeah.
-I know.

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:19.452
-How was the travels?

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.753
-It's been a challenge.

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:22.388
It's been so much fun.
I'm doing this show.

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:24.190
We're traveling.
I've been to Africa,

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:27.127
North America, Asia,
and Australia.

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:29.262
And Australia, you know...
-Gorgeous.

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.830
-...beautiful place.
The only thing,

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.733
of course, is that

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.234
everything will kill you
or hurt you.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:36.969
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, no, I'm a little afraid of,

00:00:36.969 --> 00:00:40.406
yeah, because, yeah, if you swim
in the ocean, sharks.

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:41.941
-I was swimming
in the Great Barrier Reef

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.076
and, of course, then you look
down, there is a shark,

00:00:44.076 --> 00:00:46.779
which, they keep telling you,
it's fine.

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:48.814
[ Laughter ]
And then you read the news
and someone was --

00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:49.949
No, it's not fine.
-No, that's not fine.

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:51.083
What are you talking about?
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:52.452
You have something
that happened to you.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:55.655
-Oh, yeah, no, because I was
being so cautious

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:57.156
with everything,

00:00:57.156 --> 00:00:58.591
but I got bitten
by these mosquitoes.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.560
And mosquitoes like, you know,
it's fine.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.361
-Of course.

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:02.695
-And, you know, it reacted.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.797
It got kind of big, but I was
like, "Okay, it's fine."

00:01:04.797 --> 00:01:06.699
We kept traveling.
We went to Vietnam.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:10.502
It got worse, and then these
blisters started forming

00:01:10.502 --> 00:01:12.137
[ Ewws ]
and it got even -- Yeah,

00:01:12.137 --> 00:01:13.539
[ Laughter ]
it's disgusting.

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:15.174
And then I was going to Japan

00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:18.911
and, on the flight there,
it started oozing like --

00:01:18.911 --> 00:01:20.279
[ Ewws ]
Yeah, I'm sorry.

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:22.147
[ Laughter ]
But really, like, literally,

00:01:22.147 --> 00:01:25.018
it's like I was peeing my knees
or something.

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:26.586
[ Ewws ]
I don't know how to explain it.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.220
-You just did.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:30.356
We get it. We get it.
We get it, yeah.

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:35.695
-Anyway, I make it to Japan
and a place called Takeshima

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:38.398
and I say, "I think
I should see a doctor."

00:01:38.398 --> 00:01:39.999
-Something's wrong, yeah.
-So we found,

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.568
went to this place, this doctor.

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:43.402
I mean,
even in the waiting room,

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:44.670
there's a kid walked past,

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:46.106
looked at my knees like, "Oh!"

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:48.007
[ Laughter ]
With tears in his eyes.

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.076
So, I come in,
but then this doctor,

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:51.977
she looks at my knee
and she goes -- [ Gasping ]

00:01:51.977 --> 00:01:54.680
And then she found these books
to show me these pictures

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.416
and there was like
all these disgusting images

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:57.983
and she's like, "It's like this.

00:01:57.983 --> 00:01:58.984
Worse.
Yours is worse."

00:01:58.984 --> 00:02:00.153
[ Laughter ]
-Wow!

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:02.288
-Yeah, it was disgusting.
-Doctor says that, yeah.

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.389
And you don't speak
any Japanese?

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:05.157
-I do not, no.
I had a translator

00:02:05.157 --> 00:02:08.328
and then she was helping me out.
And then this other nurse --

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:10.529
