suddenly appeared

00:02:10.529 --> 00:02:12.098
and they started treating
my legs

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:14.533
and they were kind of
wrapping it

00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:15.768
and like I looked like
"The Mummy."

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:19.805
And it worked.
I felt good. I felt safe.

00:02:19.805 --> 00:02:21.273
-You did?
-I did.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.273 --> 00:02:22.675
-You actually brought us
a photo, which I...

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:23.642
-Oh, yes.
-...want to show everyone.

00:02:23.642 --> 00:02:25.511
This is your knee
all wrapped up.

00:02:25.511 --> 00:02:26.679
Look at how happy
these women are.

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:27.847
[ Laughter ]
-I know.

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:29.616
-They're so happy
to have you in the hospital.

00:02:29.616 --> 00:02:31.150
Like, "Hey, I'll treat him!"

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.852
[ Laughter ]
"No, no I'll treat him!
I'll rub his legs!"

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:34.787
"Let me rub his legs.
No, let me rub his back."

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.889
They go, oh, yeah.
They're so psyched.

00:02:36.889 --> 00:02:38.391
-And they really saved me.

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:40.193
They saved the trip.
I'm so grateful.

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:42.361
So, if they watch this,
thank you so much.

00:02:42.361 --> 00:02:44.029
-Yeah. Come on.
-Yes.

00:02:44.029 --> 00:02:46.098
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:46.098 --> 00:02:49.168
-I want to talk about this
new series on Apple TV+.

00:02:49.168 --> 00:02:50.803
You and Jennifer Garner.
-Amazing.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.472
